    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "# ENGINE1 — ERROR HANDLING / GLOBAL FAILURE WORKFLOW\n\n**Centralized error handling for ENGINE1.** Capture failed executions across all seven canvases, record error details, identify the affected workflow and execution, and notify administrators through Slack.\n\n**PostgreSQL is the source of truth.** Preserve failure history, prevent duplicate alerts, and support controlled investigation and recovery. Never automatically retry non-idempotent operations without safeguards.\n\n**Import defaults: workflow inactive until credentials, error triggers, notifications, and recovery behavior are verified.** No secrets or sensitive customer data in logs or exported JSON.",
        "height": 290,
        "width": 690
